---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Engagement" description="Engagement options designed to meet you where you are.">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1>Engagement options</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">At Vega Financial, we believe great advice should be easy to understand and aligned to where you are right now. Whether you need a one-time second opinion or an ongoing advisory relationship, we offer engagement options designed to meet you where you are.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Hourly Consultation -->
  <section class="eng-section">
    <div class="eng-row">
      <div class="eng-intro">
        <span class="eng-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg></span>
        <h2>Hourly Consultation</h2>
        <div class="eng-label">(Advice-Only)</div>
        <p>This option is ideal for investors who want clarity around a specific question or financial decision.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="eng-cols">
          <div>
            <h3 class="incl-title">Common use cases</h3>
            <div class="check-list">
              <div class="check-item">401(k) plan review</div>
              <div class="check-item">Investment portfolio tune-up</div>
              <div class="check-item">Roth conversion and tax planning questions</div>
              <div class="check-item">Concentrated stock or risk analysis</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="incl-title">What to expect</h3>
            <div class="dot-list">
              <div class="dot-item">30-minute intake and information review</div>
              <div class="dot-item">60 to 90 minutes of analysis and recommendations</div>
              <div class="dot-item">Clear next steps you can implement independently</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="eng-price">
          <div>
            <div><span class="price">$400</span> <span class="price-unit">per hour</span></div>
            <div class="muted">Typical engagement totals $800</div>
          </div>
          <div class="price-note">Best for investors who manage their own finances but want professional confirmation or direction.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Comprehensive Strategy (Core Offering) -->
  <section class="eng-section eng-blue">
    <div class="eng-row">
      <div class="eng-intro">
        <span class="core-pill">★ Core Offering</span>
        <h2>Comprehensive Strategy</h2>
        <div class="eng-label">(Ongoing Advisory)</div>
        <p class="lead">A long-term advisory relationship built around your goals.</p>
        <p>This is Vega's core offering for households seeking continuous guidance, professional portfolio management, and proactive planning.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="eng-card">
        <h3 class="incl-title">What is included</h3>
        <div class="incl-grid">
          <div class="check-item">Customized investment strategy</div>
          <div class="check-item">Retirement and tax-aware planning</div>
          <div class="check-item">Ongoing portfolio management</div>
          <div class="check-item">Risk management coordination</div>
          <div class="check-item">Ongoing advice as your life and priorities evolve</div>
        </div>
        <hr class="eng-divider" />
        <h3 class="fees-title">Annual Advisory Fees</h3>
        <div class="fees-row">
          <div>
            <div class="fee-num">1.00<span>%</span></div>
            <p class="fee-sub">annually for households with $1 million or more in investable assets</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="fee-num">1.25<span>%</span></div>
            <p class="fee-sub">annually for households under $1 million</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="fee-disclaimer">Fees are assessed monthly and fully disclosed. Vega Financial does not receive commissions or sell investment products.</p>
        <p class="best-for"><strong>Best for:</strong> Busy professionals, pre-retirees/retirees, and families who want a trusted advisor in their corner with active, hands-on strategy execution.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Options Strategy -->
  <section class="eng-section">
    <div class="eng-row">
      <div class="eng-intro">
        <span class="eng-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18"/><polyline points="17 6 23 6 23 12"/></svg></span>
        <h2>Options Strategy</h2>
        <div class="eng-label">(Advanced Portfolio Management)</div>
        <p class="lead">Sophisticated tools used with discipline and risk controls.</p>
        <p>Options strategies add complexity and require active oversight. This engagement is designed for experienced investors who want options incorporated as part of a broader portfolio strategy.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="eng-card grey">
        <h3 class="incl-title">What is included</h3>
        <div class="incl-grid">
          <div class="check-item">Covered calls and cash-secured puts</div>
          <div class="check-item">Defined-risk strategies</div>
          <div class="check-item">Ongoing monitoring and adjustment</div>
          <div class="check-item">Clear education around risk and trade-offs</div>
        </div>
        <hr class="eng-divider" />
        <h3 class="fees-title">Annual Advisory Fee</h3>
        <div class="fee-num">1.50<span>%</span><span class="fee-unit">annually</span></div>
        <p class="fee-disclaimer">Comprehensive management including options strategy implementation and monitoring.</p>
        <p class="best-for"><strong>Best for:</strong> Investors prepared for the heightened complexity, monitoring demands, and risk exposure inherent in options-based portfolios.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Choosing the Right Engagement -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="choosing">
        <h2 class="sec-heading mb-4">Choosing the Right Engagement</h2>
        <p>Some clients begin with a one-time consultation and later move into ongoing advisory. Others start with a comprehensive strategy from day one. There is no required path.</p>
        <p>We will help you select the engagement that aligns with your goals, complexity, and level of involvement.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="cta-arrow-badge" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
      <h2>Ready to Work Together?</h2>
      <p class="cta-sub">Let's start building your personalized financial plan today.</p>
      <div class="button-group">
        <a href="/engagement/" class="btn btn-outline-light">Engagement options</a>
        <a href="https://scheduler.zoom.us/tyson-farmer/start-your-financial-journey-with-vega" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-light">Get Started Today →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
